"AnyBike supplies UK motorcycles to trade and business buyers, dealers, wholesalers and overseas importers.":"AnyBike 向贸易和商业买家、经销商、批发商及海外进口商供应英国摩托车。","Browse live stock, request one motorcycle, register as a trade buyer or build a container-ready buying list. Purchases from AnyBike are made on an agreed trade/export basis.":"浏览实时库存、申请一辆摩托车、注册为贸易买家，或创建适合集装箱运输的购买清单。AnyBike 的购买均按商定的贸易/出口条件进行。","AnyBike separates individual motorcycle enquiries from global buyer and bulk buying requests, so the right workflow reaches the right team.":"AnyBike 将单辆摩托车咨询与全球买家和批量购买请求分开处理，使正确流程到达正确团队。",
"UK motorcycles for Australian buyers":"面向澳大利亚买家的英国摩托车","UK motorcycles for New Zealand buyers":"面向新西兰买家的英国摩托车","UK stock for Malaysian dealers":"面向马来西亚经销商的英国库存","Motorcycle sourcing for Thailand":"为泰国采购摩托车","UK motorcycle supply for Singapore":"面向新加坡的英国摩托车供应","Bulk motorcycle requests for Indonesia":"面向印度尼西亚的批量摩托车需求","UK motorcycles for Kenyan buyers":"面向肯尼亚买家的英国摩托车","UK motorcycle sourcing for the USA":"为美国采购英国摩托车",
"Yes, if you are purchasing on AnyBike's trade/business sale basis. Browse Available Stock and enquire about the specific motorcycle you want.":"可以，如果您按照 AnyBike 的贸易/商业销售条件购买。浏览可用库存并咨询您想要的具体摩托车。","Yes. Bulk buyers should use the buyer request form so AnyBike can match stock and sourcing opportunities.":"可以。批量买家应使用买家申请表，以便 AnyBike 匹配库存和采购机会。","AnyBike can deliver to UK ports, freight forwarders or shipping companies. Full overseas shipping workflows are planned.":"AnyBike 可送至英国港口、货运代理或运输公司。完整的海外运输流程正在规划中。","Yes. You can provide your preferred UK freight forwarder or shipping company details.":"可以。您可提供首选英国货运代理或运输公司的详情。","Not automatically. Used motorcycles are supplied on an agreed trade/export basis. AnyBike's collection condition check is visual only. If you require a mechanical assessment, request an independent third-party inspection before purchase at your cost unless agreed otherwise in writing.":"不会自动提供。二手摩托车按商定的贸易/出口条件供应。AnyBike 提车时仅进行目视检查。如需机械评估，请在购买前自费安排独立第三方检查，除非另有书面约定。","Read AnyBike's Trade & Export Sale Policy.":"阅读 AnyBike 贸易与出口销售政策。",
"AnyBike is building a provider-neutral integration network that allows authorised dealer stock, dealership data and selected motorcycle services to connect into the AnyBike platform.":"AnyBike 正在建立供应商中立的集成网络，使授权经销商库存、经销商数据和选定摩托车服务能够连接到 AnyBike 平台。","We work with dealerships, DMS providers, website providers, stock-feed providers and technology partners. Integrations are only activated with the appropriate dealer or provider authorisation.":"我们与经销商、DMS 供应商、网站供应商、库存数据供应商和技术合作伙伴合作。只有获得适当授权后才会启用集成。","AnyBike is designed to receive authorised motorcycle stock from multiple systems without asking dealers to maintain the same inventory twice. A connected dealer can continue using its existing DMS, website or stock-management process while eligible motorcycles flow into AnyBike through an approved integration.":"AnyBike 旨在从多个系统接收授权摩托车库存，无需经销商重复维护同一库存。已连接经销商可继续使用现有 DMS、网站或库存管理流程，同时符合条件的摩托车通过批准的集成进入 AnyBike。","1. Dealer or provider authorises the connection":"1. 经销商或供应商授权连接",
"Explore independent businesses offering motorcycle freight, vehicle container loading, RoRo shipping, air freight, export packing and related UK transport services.":"浏览提供摩托车货运、车辆集装箱装载、滚装运输、空运、出口包装及相关英国运输服务的独立企业。","Listings are provided for research and comparison. Inclusion is not an endorsement, recommendation or guarantee by AnyBike.":"目录仅用于研究和比较。收录不代表 AnyBike 的认可、推荐或保证。","Different companies provide different parts of the journey. Some manage international freight from collection to destination, while others specialise in UK collection, packing, container loading or port handover.":"不同公司负责运输旅程的不同环节。有些管理从提车到目的地的国际货运，另一些专注于英国提车、包装、集装箱装载或港口交接。","A freight forwarder coordinates the movement of cargo through carriers, ports, warehouses and customs processes. For motorcycles, this may include collection, export preparation, booking, packing, documentation, marine insurance and destination-agent arrangements.":"货运代理通过承运商、港口、仓库和海关流程协调货物运输。对于摩托车，这可能包括提车、出口准备、预订、包装、文件、海运保险和目的地代理安排。","The forwarder may not physically carry the motorcycle throughout the journey. It can instead organise services supplied by shipping lines, airlines, hauliers, packers and overseas agents.":"货运代理不一定亲自运输摩托车全程，而是组织船运公司、航空公司、公路运输商、包装商和海外代理提供的服务。",
